					column: 29,
					endLine: 1,
					endColumn: 31,
				},
			],
		},
```

Since relative colour syntax allows nested colours, let's update this test to confirm they are fixed as well.

(And testing for case insensitivity.)

[Demo](https://stylelint.io/demo/#).

